{"id":"cc0aeae8dce11855","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-deg-join.md","title":"Turing 度的上半格","display":"thm-deg-join — Turing 度的上半格","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-deg-join","aliases":["20-thm-deg-join"],"display":"thm-deg-join — Turing 度的上半格","chapter":"3","section":"3.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§3.4 的基本度结构","source_pdf_pages":[96],"source_printed_pages":[60],"depends_on":["[[20-df-degle]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-df-usl]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-deg-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-deg-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-deg-join — Turing 度的上半格"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§3.4 的基本度结构"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>96</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c5e73270aea4f93\" href=\"?note=1c5e73270aea4f93\" title=\"20-df-usl\">20-df-usl</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(A)\">\\(\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b=\\deg_T(B)\">\\(\\mathbf b=\\deg_T(B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1c5e73270aea4f93\" href=\"?note=1c5e73270aea4f93\" title=\"20-df-usl\">20-df-usl</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deg\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b=\\deg_T(A\\oplus B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{USL}(\\mathcal D,\\le),\\qquad \\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf0\\le\\mathbf c].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deg\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b=\\deg_T(A\\oplus B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{USL}(\\mathcal D,\\le),\\qquad \\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf0\\le\\mathbf c].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>join 分别读取偶数和奇数位，所以是两边上界；任何共同 oracle 上界都可回答这两种查询，所以是最小上界。更换代表元不改变 join 的度。原稿把 join 公式与未声明的 Usl 谓词直接相连，现已补全结构。</p>\n<p>来源：§3.4 的基本度结构；印刷页 60；PDF 第 96 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-usl","status":"resolved","id":"1c5e73270aea4f93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-usl]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-usl]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-usl]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-usl","status":"resolved","id":"1c5e73270aea4f93","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-usl]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf b=\\deg_T(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deg\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b=\\deg_T(A\\oplus B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{USL}(\\mathcal D,\\le),\\qquad \\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf0\\le\\mathbf c].","display":true}],"bytes":1251,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e888141c21b61ce5","08b4fd5163a7f955","1c5e73270aea4f93"]}